   "slug": "about",
   "title": "The Band",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Neon Harbour are four friends from a small port town on the north coast, making loud synth-rock about long nights and short summers. We met in a school orchestra, which none of us admits to in interviews.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Since 2019 we have released two albums and an EP, played around three hundred shows and worn out one van's worth of tyres.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Ada</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Vocals, synths</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Mikko</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Guitar, more synths</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">June</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Bass, backing vocals</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Rafe</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Drums, drum machines</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:quote --><blockquote class=\"wp-block-quote\"><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Loud, bright and oddly tender.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><cite>A review of Glass Hours</cite></blockquote><!-- /wp:quote -->",
   "featured_media": "band-silhouette"
  },
  {
   "slug": "gallery",
   "title": "Gallery",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Photos from the road, the studio and the occasional muddy field.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:gallery {\"columns\":3,\"linkTo\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-3 is-cropped alignwide\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:hero-stage}}\" alt=\"A singer silhouetted on stage under pink, cyan and green light beams\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:crowd-lights}}\" alt=\"A crowd facing a stage lit with coloured beams\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:festival-field}}\" alt=\"A festival crowd with raised arms under white searchlights at sunset\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:tour-van}}\" alt=\"A van on an empty road at night under the stars\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:studio-console}}\" alt=\"A mixing console with faders and glowing level meters\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:mic-spotlight}}\" alt=\"A vintage microphone alone in a spotlight\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:neon-grid}}\" alt=\"A pink striped sun over a glowing green grid horizon\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:band-silhouette}}\" alt=\"Four band members in silhouette against a magenta glow\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:b-sides-vinyl}}\" alt=\"A violet record sleeve marked B-Sides beside a black vinyl record\"/></figure><!-- /wp:image --></figure><!-- /wp:gallery -->",
   "parent": "about"
  },
  {
   "slug": "contact",
   "title": "Contact",
   "content": "<!-- wp:columns --><div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Booking</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"mailto:booking@example.com\">booking@example.com</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Press</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p><a href=\"mailto:press@example.com\">press@example.com</a></p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --><!-- wp:column --><div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:group --><div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3} --><h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Newsletter</h3><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Write to us with the word &ldquo;signal&rdquo; and we will add you to the list.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --></div><!-- /wp:group --></div><!-- /wp:column --></div><!-- /wp:columns --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>We read everything, including the long letters about synth settings.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->"
