   "slug": "midnight-signal-is-out-now",
   "title": "Midnight Signal Is Out Now",
   "date": "2026-10-17T00:01:00",
   "excerpt": "Our second album is here: eleven songs written on night buses, recorded in a basement and mixed far too loud.",
   "content": "<!-- wp:paragraph --><p>It is finally out. Midnight Signal is eleven songs about staying up too late, missing the last train and finding the people who are also still awake. We wrote most of it over two winters and recorded it in a basement studio with no windows, which explains a lot.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>Thank you to everyone who came to the listening nights, sent us voice notes of you singing the choruses back, and waited patiently while we changed the running order nine times.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph --><!-- wp:heading --><h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">The tracklist</h2><!-- /wp:heading --><!-- wp:list {\"ordered\":true} --><ol class=\"wp-block-list\"><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Night Bus</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Midnight Signal</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Static Hearts</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Glasshouse</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Low Tide (Reprise)</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Afterglow</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Northern Line</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Copper Wire</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Slow Strobe</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Echoes in the Yard</li><!-- /wp:list-item --><!-- wp:list-item --><li>Last Call</li><!-- /wp:list-item --></ol><!-- /wp:list --><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"align\":\"wide\"} --><figure class=\"wp-block-image alignwide size-large\"><img src=\"{{media:cover-midnight-signal}}\" alt=\"Album cover for Midnight Signal with neon concentric rings\"/><figcaption class=\"wp-element-caption\">Midnight Signal, cover art</figcaption></figure><!-- /wp:image --><!-- wp:paragraph --><p>The album is on all the usual streaming services, and the vinyl (neon green, of course) ships from next week. See you on tour.</p><!-- /wp:paragraph -->",
   "categories": [
    "news"
   ],
   "tags": [
    "midnight-signal",
    "release"
   ],
   "featured_media": "cover-midnight-signal",
   "format": "standard",
